+<!-- Made by tools/docs-gen.py from devices/picasso/device.conf. Do not edit: change that, then run tools/docs-gen.py. -->
+
+
+# Redmi K30 5G (`picasso`)
+
+| | |
+|---|---|
+| Vendor | Xiaomi |
+| SoC | `sm7250` |
+| Configuration | `make picasso_defconfig` |
+| Maintainer | minhtritt1996 (README.md) |
+| Repository | [hakios-picasso](https://github.com/minhtritt1996/hakios-picasso) |
+| Firmware | `devices/picasso/pull-firmware.sh` pulls it from your own phone |
+
+## What works
+
+| Part | State | |
+|---|---|---|
+| display | partly | UEFI framebuffer; kernel attaches MiniIOMobileFramebuffer (1125x2436 on 1080x2400 panel, stride 4320); backboardd connected |
+| touch | partly | driver hakios-touch (/dev/hakios-touch) connects to backboardd IOHIDEventSystem; Novatek NT36672C on GENI SE7 SPI |
+| buttons | no |  |
+| cpu | works | SMP 4 cores; passed all 36 userland checks; launchd, backboardd, wifid, and SpringBoard running stable |
+| gpu | partly | Adreno 620: firmware a620_zap/a630_sqe/a650_gmu; UniXNU TZ zap authentication & hardware acceleration in progress |
+| storage | partly | loader surveys UFS (109 partitions, 6 units); kernel root on RAM disk; kernel panic log preserved in UFS logdump partition |
+| usb | works | loader fastboot (product xnuloader), oem paniclog (512 KB pram staging), CDC serial console |
+| network | works | dlil, lo0, and en0 (WCN3990 802.11) with live IPv4 data plane |
+| audio | works | TFA9874 amplifier on I2C @ 0x34 & SEC MI2S (GPIO 70-74); WCD938x codec over SoundWire master 2 & Bolero 1.2 TX macro (/dev/hakios-audio, /dev/hakios-mic) |
+| battery | no |  |
+| camera | no |  |
+| wifi | works | WCN3990 via MPSS PAS 4; OTA beacon scanning, 4-way WPA2 association, TX/RX Data Plane, BPF DHCP client leases IP on en0 |
+| cellular | partly | PAS mpss=0x4 booted in lineage; not integrated in HakiOS yet |
+| thermal | no |  |
+
+The state is what has been seen on this device, written down in `devices/picasso/device.conf`; a part the table does not name has not been looked at.
